        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Celabrasion, Thank You, Happy Birthday, Shake Me Down\n- People: Jay Joyce\n- Organizations: Sleeper Agent, Cage the Elephant, Mom + Pop Music\n- Topics: album releases, music production, singles\n\nFacts:\n- Celabrasion is the debut album by the American rock band Sleeper Agent.\n- Jay Joyce produced Celabrasion.\n- Celabrasion was released digitally on iTunes on August 2, 2011, via Mom + Pop Music.\n- Celabrasion was released physically on September 27, 2011.\n- John Joseph \"Jay\" Joyce is an American record producer, songwriter, and session musician.\n- Jay Joyce produced Thank You, Happy Birthday for Cage the Elephant.\n- Jay Joyce also produced Cage the Elephant's eponymous debut album.\n- Shake Me Down is the first single and fourth track on Cage the Elephant's second album Thank You, Happy Birthday.",
